Z||000000||Monkeyman||01-14-2000||04:53 AM||||I just hit 1000 posts!!!!  Yea!!!  Ogre-as my friend dogtired would say, "I'm nippin' at your heels!"  I'm so honored to have had this opportunity here on the best forum (of any kind) in the world.  I'd like to thank my friends, fellow Fieroholics, and God for making this possible.  I'd also like to thank my manager and agent.  The Emmys are very special to me.  (Whoops!  Wrong acceptance speech! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)  Seriously, I'm not trying to compete with anyone, but I'm glad that I've had the opportunity for this.  I really would like to thank everyone on this forum.  You are <B> all </B> wonderful!!!!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> to everyone  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>(and an extra little  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> to Cliff for starting this thing!)||||reg||10
